data.value:
The CSLMapView module has been updated to v6.5.3!

What’s new:
This version significantly optimizes the algorithms and adds a first-run guide to help you choose a style.

Rendering is much faster, memory use is significantly lower, and crashes are reduced;
A first-run guide helps you choose a style;
Added a font size option;
Improved the progress bar so you can track rendering;
Settings are now saved automatically;
Added district, land-use, and zone layers, with individual toggles for each district.

(English: v6.5.3 - major algorithm optimization: much faster rendering and lower memory usage, fewer crashes; first-run setup wizard; UI font size option; better progress bar; settings auto-save; new district / land-use / zone layers with per-district toggles.)

Please keep sharing your feedback!
